How to Run:
1. Open SQL Server Management Studio, connect to (localdb)\MSSQLLocalDB
2. Run the script in database/create_database.sql
3. In the terminal, navigate to src/CinemaSystem and run:
   dotnet run
4. Open http://localhost:5000 in your browser